{"id":"vod_hh_61757","vodId":"61757","provider":"hh","providerName":"豪华资源","type":2,"name":"献给某飞行员的恋歌","name_cn":"献给某飞行员的恋歌","date":"2014-01-01","year":"2014","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日本动漫","remarks":"第13话","images":{"common":"https://hhmage.com/cover/5409b229df3e46a0a6d20b2751fbe705.jpg"},"summary":"同时拥有显赫出身和悲痛过去的卡路尔·阿巴斯（花江夏树 配音），以庶民的身份和无血缘的妹妹艾丽尔（竹达彩奈 配音）登上伊斯拉，前往凯格斯高中飞行科学习。伊斯拉是一座漂浮在半空中的陆地，由巴雷特洛斯共和国等三个国家共同管理。在动力的驱动下，伊斯拉开启了遥远的征程，前往传说中的圣泉寻找“天空的尽头”。然而仅有极少数领导层成员知道，伊斯拉此行还有另一个不可告人的使命。卡路尔偶然邂逅了贵族女孩克莉亚·库鲁斯（悠木碧 配音），他们彼此互生好感，并结成飞行训练搭档，但卡路尔却不知晓他和这个女孩有着怎样痛苦的孽缘。满怀理想的少男少女遨游长空，等待他们的是何等严酷的命运……","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-06-22 01:36:02","playable":true,"episodeCount":13,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"hhm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第1话","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/mepKr92d/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第2话","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/kaz5VqYe/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第3话","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/mepKrRNd/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第4话","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/DbDrpwxe/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第5话","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/RdGxyw7e/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第6话","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/Pdy5Qp7d/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第7话","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/QeZyqmJd/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第8话","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/PdRn25qd/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第9话","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/BeXwmkWd/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10话","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/RdGxyQ7e/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11话","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/lejM7LRd/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12话","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/9aAoj9Od/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13话","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/1aMgO5Ad/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T15:46:09.445Z"}